  {
    "id": 2801005110020,
    "speaker": "ルビー",
    "text": "わ、プロデューサー！？\r\nあれっ、もしかして一緒のライブ見てた……！？",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "ruby",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/280100511/2801005110020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうみたいだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2801005110030,
    "speaker": "ルビー",
    "text": "えーっ、偶然！\r\nプロデューサーも好きなの！？",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "ruby",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/280100511/2801005110030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "や、俺は見学させてもらってただけなんだけど──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2801005110040,
    "speaker": "ルビー",
    "text": "そっか\r\nそりゃお仕事だよね",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "ruby",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/280100511/2801005110040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でも、すごくいいライブだと思ったよ！\r\n初見の俺でも楽しめる作りになっててさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2801005110050,
    "speaker": "ルビー",
    "text": "！\r\nそうなの！　やっぱりそう思うよね！？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "ruby",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/280100511/2801005110050"
  },
  {
    "id": 2801005110060,
    "speaker": "ルビー",
    "text": "見に来てくれた人へのおもてなし精神がやばいって\r\n話題のアイドルなんだけど",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "ruby",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/280100511/2801005110060"
  },
  {
    "id": 2801005110070,
    "speaker": "ルビー",
    "text": "かといってファン向けのコアな曲をやらないわけじゃなくて\r\n構成が上手いっていうか──！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "ruby",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/280100511/2801005110070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2801005110080,
    "speaker": "ルビー",
    "text": "ああっ、ねぇプロデューサー時間ある！？",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "ruby",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/280100511/2801005110080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（話し足りない、って顔だ）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──もちろん\r\nどこか入るか。感想戦しよう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2801005110090,
    "speaker": "ルビー",
    "text": "そうこなくっちゃ！\r\nさすが！　話が早い！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "ruby",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
